    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious deaths kept happening, and then suddenly, a suburban hospital shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a journalist, you step into the abandoned hospital to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the hospital are 10 medical records. Collect them and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s one problem\u2026 You\u2019re a total coward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only way to run is to scream\u2014and push yourself forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shout your way to the finish!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Mic Input</strong><br>Scream into your mic to run.<br>Running away from enemies by actually screaming makes the experience even more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(You can play without a mic, but you won\u2019t be able to run, making the game much harder.)</i><br><i>(Normal movement is done with WASD.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568460/extras/0dd10f75413f46d94b72f7a23b8fe801.poster.avif?t=1754723353\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568460/extras/0dd10f75413f46d94b72f7a23b8fe801.webm?t=1754723353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568460/extras/0dd10f75413f46d94b72f7a23b8fe801.mp4?t=1754723353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with up to 4 players!<br>Scream together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a healing item to your fallen friend and help them recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong><br>Talk to your friends while playing.<br>If you hear a scream in the distance\u2026 run for your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40<strong>Sound-sensitive Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If they hear your voice or noises you make, they may come toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a noise, it's best to get away from that spot immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move:</strong> WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run:</strong> Scream into your mic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look Around:</strong> Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up Items:</strong> Right Click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Flashlight:</strong> Left Click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settings:</strong> Esc</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to continue updating this game regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty balance adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fixes and performance improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and upload videos\u2014no permission needed!<br>Just make sure to include the game title in your video and a link to this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re not responsible for any issues caused by playing or streaming this game.<br>This guideline may change without notice.</p>",
